SUMMARY:Lloyd's: FAL/DCP/CIL — Member Modeller software updated for Pha
 se 1 syndicates’ unapproved SB
DESCRIPTION:Member Modeller software updated for Phase 1 syndicates’ un
 approved SBF and LCR submissions.\n\n▸ WHY IT MATTERS (Submission Mark
 ets): The big one. The SBF is each syndicate's business plan for the nex
 t year of account - it drives capital\, stamp capacity and Lloyd's overs
 ight categorisation. Our SBF season preview: https://opmodal.com/article
 s/sbf-season\n\nApplies to: Managing Agents\n\nOfficial entry: https://w
 ww.lloyds.com/market-resources/business-timetable
