SUMMARY:Lloyd's: LCR — Phase 2 syndicates to submit the final Lloyd's C
 apital Return (LCR) ba
DESCRIPTION:LCR - Phase 2 syndicates to submit the final Lloyd's Capital 
 Return (LCR) based on the latest Syndicate Business Forecast (SBF) submi
 ssion.  Submit via the Market Data Collection (MDC) platform by 1pm.\n\
 nPlease attach all accompanying documentation as specified in the LCR gu
 idance\, as well as Major Model Change (MMC) applications where required
  and where possible the validation report. If uploading documentation af
 ter this submission date please use SecureShare (Lloyds.com>ToolsandSyst
 ems>SecureShare>MRC - Syndicate Capital Setting).\n\n▸ WHY IT MATTERS 
 (Submission Markets): The capital return that converts business plans in
 to capital requirements. Early-view submissions here shape autumn coming
 -into-line numbers.\n\nApplies to: Managing Agents\n\nOfficial entry: ht
 tps://www.lloyds.com/market-resources/business-timetable
URL:https://www.lloyds.com/market-resources/business-timetable
CATEGORIES:LCR
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lloyd’s deadline tomorrow: LCR
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
